Adapted lessons
---------------

Lessons marked `source: adapted` are based on "Go by Example" by
Mark McGranaghan and Eli Bendersky (https://gobyexample.com,
https://github.com/mmcgrana/gobyexample), licensed under CC BY 3.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). They have been translated
into Azerbaijani, adapted and simplified. When you reuse an adapted
lesson, credit "Go by Example" (Mark McGranaghan, Eli Bendersky) as well.
At the time of writing no lesson is adapted any more; the section stays for the
history of the repository and for the design prototype.

The design prototype under design/ still contains copies of adapted
examples; the same attribution applies to them.

